{"4911380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hell o’ Halo", "steam_appid": 4911380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Lost your halo? Then report for duty in Hell.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/ffdd00af42a7a686d002461e904231da.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/ffdd00af42a7a686d002461e904231da.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/ffdd00af42a7a686d002461e904231da.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living the dream in a comfy Heaven desk job, only to get demoted to field duty in Hell just because of one stupid lost halo?! My fault? No way! Those hellish demons definitely pickpocketed my halo. To get back my prompt clock-out and workplace benefits, I'll shake down every single demon until I get it back—even if they weren't the ones who stole it in the first place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No real weapons—just office supplies with way too much attitude.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/84f836cb0354aa9d82aacc5b666d99be.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=758 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/84f836cb0354aa9d82aacc5b666d99be.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/84f836cb0354aa9d82aacc5b666d99be.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might not listen to their master, but they sure know how to smash demon skulls. Thanks to this sudden demotion, holy firearms and proper weapons are nowhere to be found. The only things in your hands are quirky office supplies that insist on doing things their own way! Build a custom deck with these unruly office tools and mercilessly slaughter the incoming waves of enemies. Wipe them all out, and they’ll have no choice but to spit your halo back out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overload cheap office supplies with Angelic Grace to unleash ultimate destruction!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/b9ce65d496fcf9cf98abd8a4a3748c1b.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/b9ce65d496fcf9cf98abd8a4a3748c1b.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/b9ce65d496fcf9cf98abd8a4a3748c1b.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the most useless trinket turns into a Hell-shredding masterwork once you infuse it with divine Angelic Grace. Are these crude office supplies not ready to handle that much power yet? Hey, there’s always a way! Forcefully forge that grace into them right up to their durability limit, transforming them into overpowered weapons of mass destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“My halo gets stolen, and now my official Angel Shop privileges are revoked too?!”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/83e4cd0cf33fa4c4e7ec8920c9c96d04.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/83e4cd0cf33fa4c4e7ec8920c9c96d04.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/83e4cd0cf33fa4c4e7ec8920c9c96d04.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting kicked down to Hell field duty was humiliating enough, but inside the cramped Hell elevator, the only thing handed to you is a crumpled flyer for 'Angel Home Shopping.' As a demoted employee banned from official Heaven stores, high-end holy weapons are out of the question. But nothing in this world is truly useless! Scour the home shopping flyer for weird and random office supplies at bargain prices, and construct your own insanely overpowered custom deck!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Lost your halo? Then report for duty in Hell.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/ffdd00af42a7a686d002461e904231da.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/ffdd00af42a7a686d002461e904231da.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/ffdd00af42a7a686d002461e904231da.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living the dream in a comfy Heaven desk job, only to get demoted to field duty in Hell just because of one stupid lost halo?! My fault? No way! Those hellish demons definitely pickpocketed my halo. To get back my prompt clock-out and workplace benefits, I'll shake down every single demon until I get it back—even if they weren't the ones who stole it in the first place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No real weapons—just office supplies with way too much attitude.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/84f836cb0354aa9d82aacc5b666d99be.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=758 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/84f836cb0354aa9d82aacc5b666d99be.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/84f836cb0354aa9d82aacc5b666d99be.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might not listen to their master, but they sure know how to smash demon skulls. Thanks to this sudden demotion, holy firearms and proper weapons are nowhere to be found. The only things in your hands are quirky office supplies that insist on doing things their own way! Build a custom deck with these unruly office tools and mercilessly slaughter the incoming waves of enemies. Wipe them all out, and they’ll have no choice but to spit your halo back out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overload cheap office supplies with Angelic Grace to unleash ultimate destruction!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/b9ce65d496fcf9cf98abd8a4a3748c1b.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/b9ce65d496fcf9cf98abd8a4a3748c1b.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/b9ce65d496fcf9cf98abd8a4a3748c1b.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the most useless trinket turns into a Hell-shredding masterwork once you infuse it with divine Angelic Grace. Are these crude office supplies not ready to handle that much power yet? Hey, there’s always a way! Forcefully forge that grace into them right up to their durability limit, transforming them into overpowered weapons of mass destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“My halo gets stolen, and now my official Angel Shop privileges are revoked too?!”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/83e4cd0cf33fa4c4e7ec8920c9c96d04.poster.avif?t=1785481220\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/83e4cd0cf33fa4c4e7ec8920c9c96d04.webm?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/extras/83e4cd0cf33fa4c4e7ec8920c9c96d04.mp4?t=1785481220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting kicked down to Hell field duty was humiliating enough, but inside the cramped Hell elevator, the only thing handed to you is a crumpled flyer for 'Angel Home Shopping.' As a demoted employee banned from official Heaven stores, high-end holy weapons are out of the question. But nothing in this world is truly useless! Scour the home shopping flyer for weird and random office supplies at bargain prices, and construct your own insanely overpowered custom deck!</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Lost your halo? Report to Hell!&quot; Demoted from a cushy Heaven desk job to field duty in Hell, your fight for clock-out times and benefits begins! Build custom decks with opinionated office supplies, smash demon skulls, and loot your halo back. Welcome to Hell—no mercy, no overtime pay!", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Spain, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/03c0417da46b75298a02fef9cbab4b4bd1a5a6ea/header.jpg?t=1785481220", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/aaed30982aa93681e1e3bca202039582b4a3a4e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785481220", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911380/aaed30982aa93681e1e3bca202039582b4a3a4e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785481220", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 770 2GB / AMD Radeon R9 280 3GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct X Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-4770K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 480 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct X Compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Team Scoville"], "publishers": ["Jungle Game Lab"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac"